dev.ambience.features.modules.client.ClickGuiModule|ClickGui|CLIENT|Opens the ClickGui
dev.ambience.features.modules.combat.AutoMaceModule|AutoMace|COMBAT|Fall smash: aim, attribute-swap mace on the hit, restore. Optional axe stun first.
dev.ambience.features.modules.combat.AutoEscModule|AutoEsc|COMBAT|Places water on cobweb you are stuck in, then scoops it back up.
