dev.ambience.features.modules.combat.CrystalOptimizerModule|CrystalOptimizer|COMBAT|Removes crystals client-side on hit so you don't wait for the server.
dev.ambience.features.modules.combat.AutoWebModule|AutoWeb|COMBAT|Places cobwebs on nearby opponents.
dev.ambience.features.modules.combat.TBotModule|TBot|COMBAT|Attacks the entity under your crosshair when in range.
dev.ambience.features.modules.combat.ProjectileAimModule|ProjectileAim|COMBAT|Smoothly aims bows, crossbows, and pearls at people.
dev.ambience.features.modules.combat.AimAssistModule|AimAssist|COMBAT|Smooth close-range aim for swords and UHC.
