dev.ambience.features.modules.combat.STapModule|STap|COMBAT|Walks back after a hit when the target approaches so they can't return the hit.
dev.ambience.features.modules.combat.JumpResetModule|JumpReset|COMBAT|Jumps the tick you take knockback so you stay in combo range.
dev.ambience.features.modules.combat.KeyPearlModule|KeyPearl|COMBAT|Throws an ender pearl from your hotbar when you press the bound key.
dev.ambience.features.modules.combat.ShieldStunModule|ShieldStun|COMBAT|When you hit a blocking player, swaps to an axe to stun their shield then swaps back.
dev.ambience.features.modules.combat.AnchorMacroModule|AnchorMacro|COMBAT|Charges and detonates placed anchors.
dev.ambience.features.modules.player.FastXpModule|FastXP|PLAYER|Throws XP bottles quickly while holding right click.
dev.ambience.features.modules.movement.AutoSprintModule|AutoSprint|MOVEMENT|Sprints after a short delay when you start moving.
dev.ambience.features.modules.movement.WindHopModule|WindHop|MOVEMENT|Throws a wind charge under you. SilentAim keeps your camera still.
dev.ambience.features.modules.movement.LungeSwapModule|LungeSwap|MOVEMENT|Jumps and stabs a Lunge spear in the same tick, then stays on the spear.
dev.ambience.features.modules.movement.PearlCatchModule|PearlCatch|MOVEMENT|Hops with a wind charge, then looks up and throws pearl + wind.
